  "description": "JSON that comes out of an LLM: extract it from prose, repair it, and parse it while it streams. Partial parsing of truncated JSON with npm partial-json semantics, live typed snapshots from any token stream (IAsyncEnumerable of string, works with any SDK), heuristic repair of markdown fences, single quotes, trailing commas, Python literals and comments, plus one-call extract-repair-parse coercion. Zero external dependencies.",
